3
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:56,880
Why are you here?

4
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,880
To show off?

5
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:02,320
Princess Xiyao wants to see you.

6
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:04,200
I'm just accompanying her.

7
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:06,240
Otherwise,

8
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:10,680
