9
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,800
Princess Xiyao.

10
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,640
You are my princess consort.

11
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:29,010
You should have shared life and death with me.

12
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:34,079
Why did you collude with Su Zhiye so quickly?

13
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:36,720
Yuwen Jia, show some respect.

14
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:41,880
I'm going back to Rouran.

15
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:51,320
My good brother really knows how to win people's hearts.

16
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,460
It has nothing to do with Prince Shuo.

17
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:57,120
The marriage alliance has been put on hold.

18
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:59,200
I have no reason to stay anymore.

19
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:06,060
Since you admit that we are husband and wife,

20
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:09,520
I can beg His Majesty to pardon you.

21
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,120
It's useless.

22
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:17,800
Even my own sisters and aunts

23
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:21,240
don't hold that much weight in his heart,

24
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:24,930
let alone a woman from beyond the Great Wall like you.

25
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:27,720
You can go back to Rouran with me,

26
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:32,600
as long as you promise never to return to the Central Plains.

27
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:34,200
For the sake of good relations between the two countries,

28
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:35,800
they will definitely agree.

29
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,600
Yuwen Jia!

30
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:44,700
Don't do anything stupid.

31
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:46,920
Why?

32
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:50,160
What did I do wrong?

33
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:53,880
Yuwen Jia, calm down.

34
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,040
Let her go.

35
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:58,200
What emperor's destiny?

36
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:02,320
What exactly did I do wrong?

37
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:05,240
Tell me.

38
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:07,560
Calm down.

39
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,320
Calm down.

40
