112
00:10:29,800 --> 00:10:32,760
The scenery of Jiangnan is truly beautiful,

113
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:37,560
The scenery of Jiangnan is truly beautiful,

114
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:41,240
Meeting you again in the season of falling flowers.

115
